                                "sense_id": "de594eb0-82a0-3661-8b83-d7966673ee47",
                                "text": "So la-da-di-da-di, we like to party / Dancing with Molly / Doing whatever we want"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0519e676-937b-45c8-ac4f-58e197874a6d",
                                "sense_id": "de594eb0-82a0-3661-8b83-d7966673ee47",
                                "text": "Was pissed now. But also hyper-lit, euphoric almost, given the adrenaline plus molly."
                            }
